      "sha256": "e40efd1f5f96397ec4ffaf927837f8bbe942ec9ff96369c314b0cecf2b812644",
      "canonical_text": "Maya stared at her mother. Usually, the robot knew what she preferred. It knew which shoes felt comfortable, how much sugar she wanted, and what kind of film would help her forget a difficult day. It even found the right words when she was too tired to answer a message.",
