      "sha256": "b391ccbc70267032003acc14a40a918258d618688260aab9f82c0f3eb043181a",
      "canonical_text": "But this was not a choice about comfort. It was about her mother's life, and her own.",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
